  "comments": "<p>Coins without mintmark dated 1961-1963 were struck in Warsaw; 1973 and 1974 were struck in Kremnica, Czechoslovakia and denoted (kr) (see the main photo of the article); with mint mark under left leg (to the right for observer) struck in Warsaw and denoted MW.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5da0330ae4915.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5da0330ae4915.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>A few groups of obverse are known.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>I</strong> - details closer to rim, thick script of circular legend.<br>Die<strong> II</strong> - details closer to center, thick script of circular legend.<br>Die <strong>III</strong> - details closer to rim, thin script of circular legend, narrow tail does not touch claw to the right.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61c779932bb61.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61c779932bb61.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><u>1957</u><br>Die<strong> I.1</strong> - small date, short nose to '1'.<br>Die <strong>I.2</strong> - large date, long nose to '1', '9' with widely open tail.<br>On the images below the left image for the obverse <strong>I.1</strong>, the right - for the obverse <strong>I.2</strong>.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d9dd14801d9e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d9dd14801d9e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><u>1976</u><br>Die<strong> I.1</strong> - wide numerals, mintmark low.<br>Die<strong> I.2</strong> - narrow high numerals, '9' and '6' with widely open tails, mintmark high.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61d01d71313eb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61d01d71313eb.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>I</strong>: 1957 I.1, 1957 I.2, 1963, 1965-1972, 1973(kr), 1976 I.1, 1976 I.2, 1977, 1978, 1979, 1979 PS, 1980, 1980 PS, 1981, 1981 PS, 1983, 1985.<br><strong>II</strong>: 1961, 1962.<br><strong>III</strong>: 1973 MW, 1973 (kr), 1973, 1975.<br><br><i>Abbreviation</i><br>PS - Proof set.</p>",
